&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Added:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Activity: Develop Hypotheses For a Business Problem
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Develop hypotheses and improvement ideas for business problem
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Identify data required to support improvement ideas and hypotheses
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Activity: Identify All Improvement Opportunities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Identify complete list of improvement opportunities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Identify short-term improvements&amp;nbsp;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Examples: 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Improvement Opportunities and Business Case - Record to Report
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Prioritized Improvement Opportunities - By Duration and Priority
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Prioritized Improvement Opportunities - By People, Process, Technology
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Edited:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Activity: Develop Improvement Opportunities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Prioritize improvement opportunities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Identify improvement opportunities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Identify strategic improvement areas
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Document enablers and dependencies
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Review and challenge initiatives and strategic improvement areas&amp;nbsp;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
